# Civil engineering research at British universities assessed as ‘world leading’

**Authors:** Adrian Long

## Abstract
<jats:p> Civil engineering research at British universities is better than ever, with 20% rated as ‘world leading’ in the government's latest research assessment exercise. Adrian Long of Queen's University Belfast, who chaired the civil engineering review panel, reports. </jats:p>

**Source:** https://doi.org/10.1680/cien.2009.162.4.150

